1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Subtract these two polynomials.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:06,433
A common mistake: flipping only the first sign.

3
00:00:06,433 --> 00:00:10,633
A minus before parentheses means −1 times everything inside…

4
00:00:10,633 --> 00:00:13,467
…so every sign flips.

5
00:00:13,467 --> 00:00:20,667
Watch it roll through: −x³, −5x², +7x.

6
00:00:20,667 --> 00:00:24,067
Now sort and combine like terms.

7
00:00:24,067 --> 00:00:26,867
The x³ terms cancel completely…

8
00:00:26,867 --> 00:00:32,767
…leaving −11x² + 9x + 4.

9
00:00:32,767 --> 00:00:38,333
A minus before parentheses flips every sign inside.
